    <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 700" role="img" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
         aria-label="Render of the Project Lightning controller board: a dark circuit board with gold traces and a lightning motif, carrying the words ZeroStick 8K Polling, Project Lightning, Built exclusively for PC, Now taking business orders">
